en:
The Opinion Bits each began to give off light
and started exchanging auras.{w}{p}Before long, the Opinion Bits
all turned toward Zaalhaut at once.{w}

"Heh, heh hah hah!{w}I see, now I get it!
No wonder I could never find the power over time!"{w}{p}"Then the fall of Shebe makes sense too!{w}If the power over time was a sham,
of course there was never any divine protection!"{w}{p}"I've been well and truly fooled!{w}Naru was no god of time...{w}...Naru was a god of light!"{w}

"Is it taken care of?"{w}{p}"Yes.{w}However much one puts on a brave front,
the gap between our very existences cannot be closed."{w}{p}"Truly, it is beyond my comprehension."{w}{p}"Even so, they got the better of us again this time."{w}{p}"Who could have guided them in?"{w}{p}"There are only two possibilities.{w}Hisbert, or else the people of Ryug."{w}{p}"So it would seem."{w}{p}"Shall we finish this one off?"{w}{p}"We may leave it be.
More importantly, we must make our report at once.{w}...Spirits. Take this one outside."{w}

{0E}"Ugh, honestly! You're all exaggerating!
If someone's in trouble, I help them.{0F}
That's only natural, right?"{w}

{0E}"One way or another, you guys sure know a lot...
I really do need to study.{0F}
And I have to work harder at alchemy, too..."{w}

{0E}"Ninja! Ninja's the way to go!
YAMURU IS DECAPITATED!{0F}
*ding* R.I.P.!"{w}

"You can just go end up
    *INSIDE THE STONE*
all by yourself!"{w}

{0E}"Those two make an Angel's Window...
I know that one, since I've made it before.{0F}
And then Ma... Mazu... Mazu-ree-tay?"{w}

{0E}"Yamuru!{0F}
...It's all right, okay?"{w}{p}"If I wanted to change classes, I wouldn't be studying alchemy.{w}I'm studying like this because
I decided to keep at it, see?"{w}

"Ah! Don't you run away, you bastard!
I didn't get to lop off a single head!
HEEEADS!!"{w}
